      "task_e8b3d487e45af06e",
      {
        "taskId": "task_e8b3d487e45af06e",
        "title": "Synthesize mixed product signals into a strategy brief",
        "description": "Turn the notes below into a concise strategy brief for leadership.\n\nReturn:\n\n3 strongest signals\n3 risks or weak points\n3 recommended next steps\n1 short recommendation\nclearly separate facts from interpretation\nRules:\n\nuse only the information below\ndo not invent market data or ROI\nif evidence is weak, say so\nkeep the output concise and structured\nNotes:\n\nSMB adoption is still strong.\nWe closed 3 recent mid-market deals around $120k ACV.\nSales cycle increased from 14 days to 35 days.\nMid-market buyers keep asking for SSO, RBAC, and audit logs.\nSMB NPS is 52.\nMid-market NPS is 44.\nWe do not yet have many enterprise references.\nLeadership wants to know whether to lean further into mid-market over the next 2 quarters.",
